# Build context exclusions. Keep this aggressive: the context is the whole
# monorepo, and node_modules alone is ~1.5GB of symlinks that pnpm recreates
# inside the image anyway.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.cache
**/dist
**/out
**/build
**/.output
**/.nitro

.git
.github
.vscode
.claude
.kimchi
.expo

# Secrets never belong in an image layer — compose injects them at runtime
# via env_file instead (see docker-compose.yml).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.docker.example

dump.rdb
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Docs / local tooling that no build stage reads
docs
README.md
LICENSE

# turbo prune output — regenerated inside the build
out
